+//
+// Krunk: the Media Router dialog for Krunk's (Alloy style) browsers. Chrome's
+// own Cast dialog is a Views bubble tied to a Chrome Browser window; Krunk
+// draws its own device picker instead. This controller keeps Chrome's
+// UI-independent model (MediaRouterUI: sinks, cast modes, routes, issues) and
+// bridges it to the embedder:
+//
+//   engine -> app  CefClient::OnProcessMessageReceived(browser, main frame,
+//                  PID_BROWSER, message) with one JSON string argument:
+//                    krunk.cast.open    the picker should open (page request
