+//                    krunk.cast.state   this tab's session (casting, device,
+//                                       media status)
+//                    krunk.cast.closed  the picker session ended
+//                  The source is PID_BROWSER, so a renderer cannot fake them.
+//   app -> engine  the pseudo-preference "krunk.cast" (a dictionary) through
+//                  CefRequestContext::SetPreference: {cmd: open|start|stop|
+//                  close|media, browser: <browser id>, ...}. See
+//                  HandleCommand().
+
+#ifndef CEF_LIBCEF_BROWSER_MEDIA_ROUTER_KRUNK_CAST_CONTROLLER_H_
